  <!-- Installation Guide Section -->
  <section class="section install-section" id="install">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <span class="section-tag cyan">Quick Start</span>
        <h2 class="section-title">How to Install AlphaFloor EFB</h2>
        <p class="section-subtitle">
          Getting up and running takes less than two minutes.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid-3 install-steps">
        <div class="step-card glass-panel">
          <div class="step-num">01</div>
          <h3 class="step-title">Place in Plugins Folder</h3>
          <p class="step-desc">
            Download and extract the <code class="code-token">AlphaFloorEFB</code> folder into your X-Plane 12 directory:
            <code class="code-block-inline">X-Plane 12/Resources/plugins/AlphaFloorEFB/</code>
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="step-card glass-panel">
          <div class="step-num">02</div>
          <h3 class="step-title">Load Any ToLiss Aircraft</h3>
          <p class="step-desc">
            Launch X-Plane 12 and load the A319, A320, A321, A330-900, or A340-600. The tablet in the 3D cockpit immediately powers on with AlphaFloor EFB.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="step-card glass-panel">
          <div class="step-num">03</div>
          <h3 class="step-title">Connect Your Tablet</h3>
          <p class="step-desc">
            Open the Settings tab on the EFB to see your local LAN URL (e.g. <code class="code-token">http://192.168.1.42:8080</code>). Type it into Safari on your iPad to fly with external touch controls!
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="install-docs-banner glass-panel">
        <div class="docs-banner-content">
          <div class="docs-banner-icon">
            <svg width="28" height="28" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 6.253v13m0-13C10.832 5.477 9.246 5 7.5 5S4.168 5.477 3 6.253v13C4.168 18.477 5.754 18 7.5 18s3.332.477 4.5 1.253m0-13C13.168 5.477 14.754 5 16.5 5c1.747 0 3.332.477 4.5 1.253v13C19.832 18.477 18.247 18 16.5 18c-1.746 0-3.332.477-4.5 1.253" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div class="docs-banner-text">
            <h4>Looking for complete operational instructions?</h4>
            <p>Our online pilot user guide details takeoff & landing performance calculations, SimBrief sync, weight & balance, and checklist customizations.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <a href="/alphafloorefb/docs/" class="btn btn-secondary btn-md">
          <span>Explore Online Docs</span>
          <svg width="16" height="16" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3" />
          </svg>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- FAQ Section -->
  <section class="section faq-section" id="faq">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <span class="section-tag">Frequently Asked Questions</span>
        <h2 class="section-title">Got Questions? We've Got Answers.</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-list">
        <div class="faq-item glass-panel">
          <h3 class="faq-question">How does AlphaFloor EFB appear in the 3D cockpit?</h3>
          <p class="faq-answer">
            AlphaFloor EFB powers the 3D pilot tablet screens inside the cockpit automatically. You don't need to configure aircraft geometry or install separate display drivers—it is ready to fly as soon as you load any supported aircraft.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-item glass-panel">
          <h3 class="faq-question">Which aircraft are currently supported?</h3>
          <p class="faq-answer">
            AlphaFloor EFB is deeply integrated and optimized for the entire <strong>ToLiss Airbus fleet</strong> (A319, A320neo, A321, A321neo/XLR, A330-900, and A340-600) with dedicated dataref synchronizations for MCDU scratchpads, weight and balance, dynamic CG envelope, doors, fuel, and ground equipment.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-item glass-panel">
          <h3 class="faq-question">Do I need an iPad or external tablet to use it?</h3>
          <p class="faq-answer">
            No! You can use AlphaFloor EFB entirely inside the X-Plane 12 3D virtual cockpit using your mouse. However, if you have an iPad, Android tablet, phone, or second PC monitor on the same Wi-Fi network, you can access the web EFB simultaneously with fluid touch gestures.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-item glass-panel">
          <h3 class="faq-question">How does the 7-day free trial work?</h3>
          <p class="faq-answer">
            When you first load the plugin in X-Plane 12, click "Start Free Trial" in the license screen. You instantly receive 7 days of full, unrestricted access to all modular apps, performance calculators, and tablet streaming. No credit card is required.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-item glass-panel">
          <h3 class="faq-question">How do I activate my license after purchasing?</h3>
          <p class="faq-answer">
            After completing your purchase via Stripe, you will be redirected to our confirmation page displaying your license key and a button to download <code class="code-token">AlphaFloorEFB.lic</code>. You can either copy-paste the key into the EFB license window or simply save <code class="code-token">AlphaFloorEFB.lic</code> into <code class="code-token">X-Plane 12/Resources/plugins/AlphaFloorEFB/</code>.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
